:::text id=OB25Ef4kd_ at=top-center width=86% height=144 offsetY=64 preset=title align=center
# Debugging Huy — Known Issues & Support Plan
:::

:::icon id=tNwlHZ7LqT at=center width=240 offsetX=-416 offsetY=-56 name=help-circle size=56 color=#F97316
:::

:::text id=8DcEHmx24p at=center width=240 height=160 offsetX=-416 offsetY=80 preset=body align=center
**Ask too many questions when a problem is not fully understood before committing.**
*Support*: Provide clear context and explain how it is relevant to the business, product, or team.
:::

:::icon id=u9eba6JwGf at=center width=240 offsetX=-136 offsetY=-56 name=battery-charging size=56 color=#F97316
:::

:::text id=MUbhAwp5Tl at=center width=240 height=160 offsetX=-136 offsetY=80 preset=body align=center
**Respond slowly when running on low energy.**
*Support*: Give time to recover, still feel free to ask for faster response if urgent.
:::

:::icon id=PWzBe0Qdar at=center width=240 offsetX=144 offsetY=-56 name=message-square size=56 color=#F97316
:::

:::text id=wV0xYU0pWH at=center width=240 height=128 offsetX=144 offsetY=80 preset=body align=center
**Tend to be incoherent when getting over-excited.**
*Support*: Give time to let things sink in, and echo back what you hear if possible.
:::

:::icon id=dp-_D28Ib_ at=center width=240 offsetX=424 offsetY=-56 name=alert-triangle size=56 color=#F97316
:::

:::text id=bGhkOHNcAU at=center width=240 height=128 offsetX=424 offsetY=80 preset=body align=center
**Sometimes pushing too hard on self and people.**
*Support*: Explain if it's not working or if energy is better spent in other ways.
:::
